<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your One-Time Password</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f7f6; margin: 0; padding: 20px; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .header { text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #eaeaea; padding-bottom: 20px; }
    .title { color: #1e293b; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; }
    .content { padding: 24px 0; }
    .otp-box { background: #f1f5f9; border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 6px; color: #0f172a; margin: 24px 0; }
    .footer { border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea; padding-top: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 class="title"><%= appName %></h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello <strong><%= userName || 'there' %></strong>,</p>
      <p>Here is your One-Time Password (OTP) for verification. This code is valid for <strong><%= expiresInMinutes || 10 %> minutes</strong>.</p>
      <div class="otp-box"><%= otp %></div>
      <p>If you did not request this verification code, please ignore this email.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= appName %>. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
